OL,3,AGP says she was forced out of job after
OL,4,Araising concerns about gender treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who raised concerns about the
OL,7,Ftreatment of children questioning their
OL,8,Fgender has told the BBC she was accused
OL,9,Fof transphobia, bullied and harassed
OL,10,Fout of her child protection job in the
OL,11,FNHS.
OL,13,FDr Sarah Redvers, who was a named
OL,14,Fsafeguarding GP, said she faced a
OL,15,Fbrutal investigation after she passed
OL,16,Fon complaints brought to her by other
OL,17,Fdoctors.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
