OL,3,AGP says she was forced out of job after
OL,4,Araising concerns about gender treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking publicly for the first time,
OL,7,FRedvers said she felt she was
OL,8,F"silenced" for doing her job after
OL,9,Fquestioning whether another GP was
OL,10,Fappropriately assessing the needs of
OL,11,Fyoung people who were distressed about
OL,12,Ftheir gender identity.
OL,14,FShe has brought a claim of constructive
OL,15,Fdismissal against the NHS Sussex
OL,16,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB), which
OL,17,Fmanaged health services in the county,
OL,18,Fand Adam Doyle, who was the ICB's chief
OL,19,Fexecutive until 2025.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
